# Copy to real environment variables in Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables), or `export` them for a local run. NOTHING here is required to get the
# site working — Property Finder needs no key. These only turn on the PAID sources.

# Your own Apify API token. Turns on BOTH Facebook and Dubizzle (they run only when you
# click the "Include Facebook & Dubizzle" button, so they only cost on demand).
# Get one free at https://apify.com → Console → Settings → Integrations → API tokens.
APIFY_API_TOKEN=

# Optional: override the default Dubizzle actor (default: logiover/dubizzle-scraper, ~$1.50/1000).
# APIFY_DUBIZZLE_ACTOR=

# Optional: Bayut via Apify. Not recommended — the only working actor is ~$349/1000.
# APIFY_BAYUT_ACTOR=
